  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 103.08 Blended sample",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 103.08 “Blended sample” means a sample that is representative of the water being distributed to consumers, where water is supplied from more than one source and the sources operate simultaneously or are automatically alternated between pump operating cycles and the water is combined before entering the distribution system.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Dw 100) #10606, eff 6-1-14",
